time":95.41,"text":"Creation of doom. / 厄运的造物"},{"time":98.5,"text":"A dying nation. / 垂死的国度"},{"time":101.33,"text":"Like a blessing curse. / 像一个受祝福的诅咒"},{"time":104.85,"text":"Kill them all! / 杀死他们！"},{"time":119.22,"text":"I still despise you, useless mother f***er. / 我依然看不起你，没用的东西"}]},{"title":"11 COCOON","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"作词: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":1.0,"text":"作曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":2.0,"text":"编曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":26.98,"text":"Are we a cog inside the fake descent? / 我们是虚假血统里的一个齿轮么？"},{"time":29.53,"text":"Who knows? / 谁会知道呢？"},{"time":30.22,"text":"The chain around is the proof of the fall. / 缠绕的锁链是我们沦陷的证明"},{"time":33.4,"text":"We all suffering in the destruction. / 我们都在消亡中承受着疼痛"},{"time":35.8,"text":"We all know. / 我们都清楚"},{"time":36.64,"text":"The flow of retribution imprison my soul. / 惩戒之涓禁锢着我的灵魂"},{"time":52.33,"text":"I see the sky fall down. / 我望着天幕落下"},{"time":55.53,"text":"Inside, tear me apart. / 内心将我分崩离析"},{"time":58.73,"text":"My soul bleed out a song. / 我的魂魄流淌出乐章"},{"time":61.94,"text":"We were stars, once lost but found. / 我们曾是失而复得的星河"},{"time":66.88,"text":"I will light the sky. / 终会将天际点亮"},{"time":83.67,"text":"Are we a cog inside the fake descent? / 我们是虚假血统里的一个齿轮么？"},{"time":86.28,"text":"Who knows? / 谁会知道呢？"},{"time":87.01,"text":"The chain around is the proof of the fall. / 缠绕的锁链是我们沦陷的证明"},{"time":90.16,"text":"We all suffering in the destruction. / 我们都在消亡中承受着疼痛"},{"time":92.56,"text":"We all know. / 我们都清楚"},{"time":93.45,"text":"The flow of retribution imprison my soul. / 惩戒之涓禁锢着我的灵魂"},{"time":99.89,"text":"The sky will see all the destruction. / 天空会见证着所有的毁灭"},{"time":105.63,"text":"We all know the end is near. / 我们都知晓终焉将要来临"},{"time":109.07,"text":"I see the sky fall down. / 我望着天幕落下"},{"time":112.27,"text":"Inside, tear me apart. / 内心将我分崩离析"},{"time":115.54,"text":"My soul bleed out a song. / 我的魂魄流淌出乐章"},{"time":118.77,"text":"We were stars, once lost but found. / 我们曾是失而复得的星河"},{"time":123.64,"text":"I will light the sky. / 终会将天际点亮"},{"time":127.7,"text":"Last horn, last angel. / 最后的号角，最后的天使"},{"time":130.9,"text":"Last hope we all searching for. / 我们一同追寻最后的希望"},{"time":134.19,"text":"Come with me. / 跟着我吧"},{"time":135.77,"text":"Fall with me. / 和我坠落"},{"time":137.55,"text":"Dissolving all the hallucination now. / 一同去溶解虚幻之像"},{"time":190.14,"text":"I see the sky fall down. / 我望着天幕落下"},{"time":193.35,"text":"Inside, tear me apart. / 内心将我分崩离析"},{"time":196.61,"text":"My soul bleed out a song. / 我的魂魄流淌出乐章"},{"time":199.81,"text":"We were stars, once lost but found. / 我们曾是失而复得的星河"},{"time":204.73,"text":"I will light the sky. / 终会将天际点亮"},{"time":207.96,"text":"I won’t blind my eyes. / 我不会盲目双眼"},{"time":212.42,"text":"I will fight till I die. / 我会燃尽生命去战斗"}]},{"title":"12 Echo of null","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"作词: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":1.0,"text":"作曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":2.0,"text":"编曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":32.59,"text":"红色燃烧的光芒"},{"time":36.3,"text":"满溢而出的膨胀"},{"time":39.34,"text":"梦的长廊 虚幻无常"},{"time":43.12,"text":"沉默 坠落 无边无际远方"},{"time":47.12,"text":"带着那无畏者不朽的璀璨信仰"},{"time":52.46,"text":"风呼啸身旁"},{"time":54.58,"text":"就算会成为不存在的褪色勋章"},{"time":60.04,"text":"不要将我遗忘"},{"time":62.16,"text":"I deny. / 我否认"},{"time":65.42,"text":"All the ages fade out by my side. / 所有在我身旁消散的时代"},{"time":69.14,"text":"徘徊在空荡的人海"},{"time":72.88,"text":"挣扎着留下存在"},{"time":77.08,"text":"I deny. / 我否认"},{"time":80.36,"text":"All the pages burn out by my side. / 所有在我身旁燃尽的篇章"},{"time":84.08,"text":"坠落在理想的残骸"},{"time":87.86,"text":"回响扩散成空白"},{"time":92.52,"text":"生却短暂的锋芒"},{"time":96.27,"text":"纵然渺小的火光"},{"time":99.32,"text":"也能灼伤 恐惧的墙"},{"time":103.09,"text":"要让 真相 不会再被埋葬"},{"time":107.07,"text":"带着那无畏者不朽的璀璨信仰"},{"time":112.45,"text":"风呼啸身旁"},{"time":114.56,"text":"就算会成为不存在的褪色勋章"},{"time":120.02,"text":"不要将我遗忘"},{"time":122.11,"text":"I deny. / 我否认"},{"time":125.34,"text":"All the ages fade out by my side. / 所有在我身旁消散的时代"},{"time":129.09,"text":"徘徊在空荡的人海"},{"time":132.83,"text":"挣扎着留下存在"},{"time":137.07,"text":"I deny. / 我否认"},{"time