time":73.08,"text":"I am your fate. / 我是你的宿命"},{"time":76.17,"text":"With thousand hope fade away. / 伴随着万千希望的消散"},{"time":78.92,"text":"We know the evil inside. / 我们知道内心的邪恶"},{"time":81.61,"text":"Stand by my side. / 也与我们同一战线"},{"time":84.16,"text":"I am your fall. / 我是你的衰落"},{"time":87.19,"text":"With thousand fault pass away. / 伴随着万千过错的逝去"},{"time":89.91,"text":"Become the will gaze for aye. / 成为永恒凝视的意志"},{"time":92.72,"text":"And shatter with your lies. / 随着你的谎言消亡吧"},{"time":94.81,"text":"I am destruction of the will. / 我是期许的毁灭者"},{"time":97.56,"text":"I am thy final pain inside the shell. / 我是汝等躯壳中最后的痛楚"},{"time":100.62,"text":"Kneel for me. / 为我跪下"},{"time":102.05,"text":"Ether lead the star, shine like the scar. / 苍穹带领星辰，闪耀如同伤痕"},{"time":105.11,"text":"Sing hymns of my feats. / 传唱歌颂我功绩的赞歌吧"},{"time":106.86,"text":"My curse born for swell. / 我的诅咒为膨胀而生"},{"time":108.58,"text":"I am thy false ego inside the shell. / 我是汝等躯壳中虚伪的自我"},{"time":111.67,"text":"Bleed for me. / 为我流血"},{"time":113.11,"text":"I will fall the star, leave world the scar. / 我将陨落星辰，予以世界伤痕"},{"time":116.17,"text":"Amuse me, make me laugh. / 取悦我，博我一笑吧"},{"time":174.8,"text":"I am destruction of the will. / 我是期许的毁灭者"},{"time":177.54,"text":"I am thy final pain inside the shell. / 我是汝等躯壳中最后的痛楚"},{"time":180.63,"text":"Kneel for me. / 为我跪下"},{"time":182.07,"text":"Ether lead the star, shine like the scar. / 苍穹带领星辰，闪耀如同伤痕"},{"time":185.1,"text":"Sing hymns of my feats. / 传唱歌颂我功绩的赞歌吧"},{"time":186.85,"text":"My curse born for swell. / 我的诅咒为膨胀而生"},{"time":188.6,"text":"I am thy false ego inside the shell. / 我是汝等躯壳中虚伪的自我"},{"time":191.66,"text":"Bleed for me. / 为我流血"},{"time":193.1,"text":"I will fall the star, leave world the scar. / 我将陨落星辰，予以世界伤痕"},{"time":196.13,"text":"Amuse me, make me laugh. / 取悦我，博我一笑吧"},{"time":202.73,"text":"Make me laugh. / 博我一笑吧"},{"time":209.25,"text":"Go on, enjoy the judgement. / 继续，享受这场审判"},{"time":212.0,"text":"Shout out, my name loud. / 呐喊，我的名字如雷贯耳"},{"time":214.07,"text":"I, non-believer, god builder. / 我，毫无信仰，缔造神明"}]},{"title":"7 -WIRED-","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"作曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":1.0,"text":"编曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":5.0,"text":"纯音乐，请欣赏"}]},{"title":"8 PROTOCOL 7 (feat.亢毛毛)","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"作词: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":1.0,"text":"作曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":2.0,"text":"编曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":28.59,"text":"生存在记忆之间"},{"time":30.4,"text":"真相 皆为谎言"},{"time":32.3,"text":"世界被填满伪善"},{"time":33.98,"text":"直到双眼习惯黑暗"},{"time":43.4,"text":"Oh Lord!"},{"time":44.63,"text":"看看你创造的世界"},{"time":47.21,"text":"Oh Lord!"},{"time":48.38,"text":"人与人互相欺骗"},{"time":51.02,"text":"Oh Lord!"},{"time":52.17,"text":"看看你深爱的世界"},{"time":54.78,"text":"Oh Lord!"},{"time":55.93,"text":"是不是如你所愿？"},{"time":71.57,"text":"意识在集体之间"},{"time":73.43,"text":"盖亚 无边无沿"},{"time":75.29,"text":"所有人共享连接"},{"time":76.96,"text":"舍弃肉体 重启一切"},{"time":82.62,"text":"神明 重现"},{"time":92.28,"text":"We all in 8Hz. / 吾等皆于舒曼波之下。"},{"time":95.22,"text":"Thy PSYCHE, thy EGO / 汝等之魂魄；汝等之自我。"},{"time":99.69,"text":"We will Obliterate. / 吾等将抹杀殆尽。"}]},{"title":"9 解体诸因","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"作词: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":1.0,"text":"作曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":2.0,"text":"编曲: Aya-亚夜-"},{"time":28.12,"text":"Redeem the dying soul, ignite the crimson ocean flow./救赎垂死之魄，燃起赤色之流。"},{"time":32.15,"text":"Reflect the criminal creatures, a million hate grow./映出负罪造物，滋生无尽憎恶。"},{"time":36.24,"text":"I rise the bloody flag, under the blackened sun./吾于污秽之阳下挥舞血旗。"},{"time":40.47,"text":"In hell we yell!/吾于三途之川间呐喊嘶吼！"},{"time":68.76,"text":"生灵隐藏着形迹"},{"time":70.7,"text":"钟声掩盖了气息"},{"time":72.8,"text":"杀戮吞噬着四季"},{"time":74.81,"text":"挥剑 风驰霆击"},{"time":76.84,"text":"啼哭声沉入海底"},{"time":78.79,"text":"血液凝聚成足迹"},{"time":80.88,"text":"躯体也燃烧殆尽"},{"time":82.98,"text":"世界 崩溃分离"}]}]}